#: ../../language/error_codes/E0091.md:1
msgid "E0091"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0091.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `unused_errdefer`"
msgstr "警告名称：`unused_errdefer`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0091.md:5
msgid ""
"An `errdefer` statement cannot run because the rest of its body cannot raise "
"an error. Unlike `defer`, `errdefer` performs its cleanup only when control "
"leaves the body by raising an error."
msgstr ""
"`errdefer` 语句无法执行，因为其主体的剩余部分不可能抛出错误。与 `defer` 不"
"同，`errdefer` 仅在控制流因抛出错误而离开主体时执行清理。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0091.md:9
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0091.md:11
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn run() -> Unit {\n"
"  errdefer println(\"cleanup\")\n"
"  println(\"operation completed\")\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0091.md:15
msgid ""
"The statements after `errdefer` complete normally, so its cleanup is unused."
msgstr "`errdefer` 后的语句会正常结束，因此其清理操作不会被使用。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0091.md:17
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修改建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0091.md:19
msgid ""
"Remove the statement if no cleanup is needed. Use `defer` for cleanup that "
"must always run, or keep `errdefer` before an operation that can raise an "
"error when the cleanup is needed only on failure."
msgstr ""
"如果不需要清理，请移除该语句。需要始终执行清理时使用 `defer`；仅在失败时需要"
"清理，则将 `errdefer` 放在可能抛出错误的操作之前。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0091.md:23
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"fn operation_that_may_fail() -> Unit raise {\n"
"  fail(\"operation failed\")\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn run() -> Unit raise {\n"
"  errdefer println(\"cleanup\")\n"
"  operation_that_may_fail()\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
